  "faq": [
    {
      "question": "What is Borivali West known for?",
      "answer": "Borivali West is known for being the gateway to Sanjay Gandhi National Park (the largest urban national park in the world), its vibrant Gujarati community, IC Colony's well-planned residential layout, and being one of Mumbai's most self-sufficient suburbs with excellent Western Railway connectivity."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the pin code of Borivali West?",
      "answer": "Borivali West primarily uses pin code 400092. Some pockets like IC Colony and Shimpoli also fall under 400092, while parts near the Borivali station area may use 400091."
    },
    {
      "question": "What are the sub-areas within Borivali West?",
      "answer": "The main micro-localities within Borivali West are IC Colony, Shimpoli, Eksar, Dahanukarwadi, Chandavarkar Road, Poisar, Kasturba Road, and the areas near Borivali Station (West)."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the property price in Borivali West?",
      "answer": "Property prices in Borivali West range from ₹80 lakh for a 1BHK near Chandavarkar Road to ₹1.5–2.2 Cr for a 2BHK in IC Colony, and ₹2.2–3.5 Cr for premium 3BHK in Shimpoli or Eksar. Rental rates range from ₹18,000 to ₹60,000 per month depending on the sub-area and flat size (as of June 2026)."
    },
    {
      "question": "How to commute from Borivali West?",
      "answer": "Borivali West is served by Western Railway's Borivali Station (35 min to Churchgate), Metro Line 2A (Dahisar to DN Nagar) with stops at Borivali, IC Colony and Eksar, BEST bus routes 271, 272, 294, 295, 451, and direct access to the Western Express Highway. The area is also the last major suburb before Mira-Bhayander."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which hospitals are in Borivali West?",
      "answer": "Major hospitals in and near Borivali West include Wockhardt Hospital, Bhagwati Municipal Hospital, Riddhi Vinayak Hospital, Shree Sai Hospital, and Lifeline Hospital."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which schools are in Borivali West?",
      "answer": "Notable schools in Borivali West include St. Francis D'Assisi High School (SSC), Gurukul School (CBSE), Podar International School, Swami Vivekanand International School, and IC Colony's Don Bosco High School."
    },
    {
      "question": "How do I find the best dentists in Borivali West?",
      "answer": "Browse Mumbai96's Borivali West listings, read reviews from locals and call directly. Our verified directory makes it easy."
    }
